      "product_summary": "Wide toe-box mesh walking sneakers with long curved teardrop-shaped side panels. Fine lines around the toe and a low sole profile give the upper a flowing casual appearance. Four color choices help buyers build a broader neutral assortment around one lace-up silhouette.\nBlack, Dark Grey, Light Grey, Khaki; EU 36-48 provide color and size choices for wholesale assortments.",
